    "created_at": "2015-12-23T15:58:08Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-12-23T17:04:42Z",
    "body": " As discussed above because it is not supported anymore. The Table sorting model in https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/tables.html#table-sorting-model and one of it's example below it needs to be removed. There is one more example related to it https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/semantics.html#dom-data-value this needs to be removed too.\n",
